{"title":"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The point in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />-plane with coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/6/ea696d161bb3f399bf32ee542551fedbd3865a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1000, 2012)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> is reflected across the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0bcb38bae415f3c8f7c1de37704a2a9a9cfedd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" />.  What are the coordinates of the reflected point?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a81e7d2df9331afd890d22ed9b6cec5d877a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ (998,2012)\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ (1000,1988)\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ (1000,2024)\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ (1000,4012)\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ (1012,2012)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"767\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc68921ed725be6783818b7841df39f0e4fc3d9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" /> is a horizontal line located <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units beneath the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/6/ea696d161bb3f399bf32ee542551fedbd3865a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1000, 2012)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />. When a point is reflected about a horizontal line, only the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> - coordinate will change. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> - coordinate remains the same. Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate of the point is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units above the line of reflection, the new <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> - coordinate  will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d69fa69d78886bc33ce602af10bcc935111b8066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000 - 12 = 1988$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"136\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, the coordinates of the reflected point are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/b/0db93e071bed389ef95c87bb566a6929523899ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1000, 1988)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B\">2012 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b